OL,3,GNEWSAPlans approved for new medical
OL,4,Acentre in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been given the go-ahead for
OL,7,Fa new medical centre in Enderby.
OL,9,FBlaby District Council's planning
OL,10,Fcommittee approved on Thursday a
OL,11,Fplanning application from One Medical
OL,12,FProperty to build a new centre on the
OL,13,Fformer playing fields of Danemill
OL,14,FPrimary School.
OL,16,FAccording to the council, the new
OL,17,Fcentre, on Townsend Road - which will
OL,18,Freplace the existing centre on
OL,19,FShortridge Lane - would feature 13
OL,20,Fconsulting rooms, a dedicated car park
OL,21,Fand an on-site pharmacy.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
